SUMMARY:The Holiday in Concert
LOCATION:Dolby Theatre\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with a special 20th Anniversary pr
 
esentation of The Holiday in Concert\, live at the Dolby Theatre in Hollywo
 
od on November 27. Experience the beloved 2006 romantic comedy like never b
 
efore as the complete film plays on a cinema-size HD screen while a live or
 
chestra performs its enchanting score in perfect sync. Starring Cameron Dia
 
z\, Kate Winslet\, Jude Law\, and Jack Black\, The Holiday follows two wome
 
n living 6\,000 miles apart who swap homes for Christmas and unexpectedly f
 
ind themselves exactly where they need to be. Filled with romance\, humor\,
 
 unforgettable music\, and all the warmth of the season\, this one-night-on
 
ly concert experience is the perfect way to kick off the holidays in Hollyw
 
ood. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-holiday-in-concert-ho
 
